{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《夫妻的博弈》12日播映一集，郭柏妍以高海寧同款鬈髮配眼鏡造型搞笑亮相，十足翻版「林亞珍」，極具喜感的模樣讓觀眾捧腹大笑！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講到假閨密Sherman雪文（郭柏妍飾）與渣男施繼威（張頴康飾）背著Senna幸如（高海寧飾）發展秘密關係，而渴望徹底擺脫賤人的Senna竟然開心到發起夢來！ </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3733f376-5b73-4b20-9353-494122a05e37.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026mZb8G6D9Fv1786589614.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3733f376-5b73-4b20-9353-494122a05e37.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4254ce1f-8729-4d5b-b4c0-3604753545fe.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026GR6pVZGFOB1786589617.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4254ce1f-8729-4d5b-b4c0-3604753545fe.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">本來在Senna的「預知夢」中，婚後她慘遭惡毒奶奶李佩貞（林漪娸飾）與「媽寶渣男」全方位壓榨，下場淒慘。如今，這場噩夢竟原封不動地在「綠茶姊妹」Sherman身上上演！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Sherman不但下班後被瘋狂使喚做盡家務，甚至連老公親手餵的一塊水果，都被奶奶以「生果生冷」為由強行阻止，完全被當成工人姐姐和生育工具，大快人心的情節讓觀眾直呼痛快解氣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T13:20:06.960509+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}